{"id": "48403", "title": "徐东明文集", "author": "徐东明", "category": "文学名著", "count": 50, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/48/48403/48403s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/48/48403.htm", "intro": "徐东明，男，1964年11月11日出生。1982年开始发表作品，曾在《诗刊》、《青年文学》、《萌芽》、《鸭绿江》、《百花洲》、《星火》、《诗歌报》、《北方文学》、《飞天》、《滇池》、《五月》、《工人日报》、《中国青年报》等一百多家报刊发表各类文章400多首（篇），荣获全国“诗神杯”、“星火杯”、“飞天杯”“黄鹤楼杯”等文学奖，1988年荣获中国学联、青联和《中国青年报》举办的“和平”征文第二名，《工人日报》全国职工创作奖，作品入选多种书籍。1992年加入江西作家协会。", "base": "files/article/html/48/48403", "chapters": [{"title": "散文卷", "volume": true}, {"title": "不惑之年说困惑", "file": "6588023.html", "available": false}, {"title": "悠悠黄鹤楼", "file": "6588024.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三清山游记", "file": "6588025.html", "available": false}, {"title": "岩泉即景", "file": "6588026.html", "available": false}, {"title": "王安石和他的变法", "file": "6588027.html", "available": false}, {"title": "话说孔子", "file": "6588028.html", "available": false}, {"title": "诗生活手记", "file": "6588029.html", "available": false}, {"title": "唱唱反调", "file": "6588030.html", "available": false}, {"title": "我所认识的几个隐士", "file": "6588031.html", "available": false}, {"title": "李白的平民生活", "file": "6588032.html", "available": false}, {"title": "童年的记忆", "file": "6588033.html", "available": false}, {"title": "甲午百年祭", "file": "6588034.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一个人的龙虎山", "file": "6588035.html", "available": false}, {"title": "酒道", "file": "6588036.html", "available": false}, {"title": "汶川备忘录", "file": "6588037.html", "available": false}, {"title": "举世皆浊我独清", "file": "6588038.html", "available": false}, {"title": "奥运随想", "file": "6588039.html", "available": false}, {"title": "千秋网事", "file": "6588040.html", "available": false}, {"title": "北京印象", "file": "6588041.html", "available": false}, {"title": "紫禁城的幽灵", "file": "6588042.html", "available": false}, {"title": "圆明园的导火索", "file": "6588043.html", "available": false}, {"title": "梦游西藏", "file": "6588044.html", "available": false}, {"title": "诗歌卷", "volume": true}, 